allenge alone or enjoy party moments by inviting a friend to join in split-screen with local or online multiplayer (via Remote Play Together).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/d40432c578ed30ad6added4f2b44509d.poster.avif?t=1753651252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/d40432c578ed30ad6added4f2b44509d.webm?t=1753651252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/d40432c578ed30ad6added4f2b44509d.mp4?t=1753651252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World and Exploration:</strong> Nebegarde is a vast territory full of dangers and mysteries. Explore varied environments, discover secrets, and forge alliances with NPCs to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party System and Cooperation:</strong> Control different members of your group, each with unique abilities that can be combined to overcome challenges and solve complex puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Graphics and Design:</strong> A visual style that mixes realistic elements with cel-shaded stylized art, evoking the aesthetic of graphic novels and comic books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Narrative and Dilemma System:</strong> Your decisions shape the world around you. The game's dilemma system offers multiple ways to complete quests and solve puzzles, with outcomes that deeply affect the story's progression.</p>",
